# Change Proposals Directory

This directory contains generated change proposals for human review.

## Workflow
1. Extraction agents analyze ecosystem repos
2. change-proposer agent generates proposals
3. Human reviews and approves/rejects
4. Approved changes are actioned (PRs created)

## File Naming
- `YYYY-MM-DD-proposals.md` - Daily proposal batches
- `approved/` - Archived approved proposals with PR links
